ads_-_pompeii_villa_of_cicero_-_napoli_man_9297_-_01.jpg?width=1920&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 1920w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/7b9870d6-91a0-45cf-bc19-f8c60037580d/test-v3-wall_painting_-_dancing_maenads_-_pompeii_villa_of_cicero_-_napoli_man_9297_-_01.jpg?width=2048&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 2048w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/7b9870d6-91a0-45cf-bc19-f8c60037580d/test-v3-wall_painting_-_dancing_maenads_-_pompeii_villa_of_cicero_-_napoli_man_9297_-_01.jpg?width=3840&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 3840w\" src=\"https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/7b9870d6-91a0-45cf-bc19-f8c60037580d/test-v3-wall_painting_-_dancing_maenads_-_pompeii_villa_of_cicero_-_napoli_man_9297_-_01.jpg?width=3840&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"sc-c0f26063-1 cXFFat\">\u003Cdiv class=\"sc-c0f26063-6 cJoMvV\">\u003Cdiv class=\"group z-10 inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center peer gap-0 sm:gap-0\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M17 3H7c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L5 21l7-3 7 3V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 15l-5-2.18L7 18V5h10v13z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003Cspan class=\"flex-shrink-0 font-sans hidden group-hover:inline\">Save\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"sc-c0f26063-3 dwDZqP font-mono peer-hover:hidden\">essay\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"sc-c0f26063-2 cA-dtSP font-mono peer-hover:hidden\">Dance and theatre\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"m-x-0 mt-3.5 mb-3 font-bold font-serif text-[25px] leading-[1.2] [grid-area:title] sm:text-[28px]\">Why the old man dances\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"mt-0 mb-3.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-normal [grid-area:standfirst]\">Religious ritual to appease the gods or free expression of human agency? For the ancient Romans, dance could be both\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"sc-c0f26063-0 sc-c0f26063-8 Yva-Dw jfoikg\">Karin Schlapbach\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"sc-c0f26063-4 gLchsi\">\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"/essays/scientists-are-no-longer-sure-the-universe-began-with-a-bang\">\u003Cdiv class=\"sc-c0f26063-7 jQxQLA\">\u003Cdiv type=\"essay\" class=\"sc-31fe189a-2 gUHfgD\">\u003Cimg alt=\"Tiny planet photo of a snowy mountain under a starry sky and Milky Way galaxy with glowing horizon.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 960px) 45vw, (max-width: 1440px) 30vw, 430px\" srcset=\"https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=256&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 256w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=384&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 384w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=640&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 640w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=750&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 750w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=828&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 828w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=1080&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 1080w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=1200&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 1200w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=1920&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 1920w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=2048&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 2048w, https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=3840&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto 3840w\" src=\"https://images.aeonmedia.co/images/0a541c82-abfd-48cb-9ad6-ffc1e7019588/essay-littleplanetgalibier-camilleniel2048.jpg?width=3840&amp;quality=75&amp;format=auto\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"sc-c0f26063-1 cXFFat\">\u003Cdiv class=\"sc-c0f26063-6 cJoMvV\">\u003Cdiv class=\"group z-10 inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center peer gap-0 sm:gap-0\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M17 3H7c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L5 21l7-3 7 3V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 15l-5-2.18L7 18V5h10v13z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003Cspan class=\"flex-shrink-0 font-sans hidden group-hover:inline\">Save\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"sc-c0f26063-3 dwDZqP font-mono peer-hover:hidden\">essay\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"sc-c0f26063-2 cA-dtSP font-mono peer-hover:hidden\">Cosmology\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"m-x-0 mt-3.5 mb-3 font-bold font-serif text-[25px] leading-[1.2] [grid-area:title] sm:text-[28px]\">Exploding the Big Bang\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"mt-0 mb-3.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-normal [grid-area:standfirst]\">It was thought that science could tell us about the origins of the Universe. Today that great endeavour is in serious doubt\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"sc-c0f26063-0 sc-c0f26063-8 Yva-Dw jfoikg\">Daniel Linford\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"sc-c0f26063-4 gLchsi\">\u003Cspan class=\"sc-c0f26063-5 jQGEAp\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" width=\"20px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"